 "summary": "Searches of Mathlib (`GramMatrix.lean`, determinant and ideal APIs) and Tau Ceti (`Gram.lean`, `MaximalMinor.lean`, `Triangular.lean`) found no existing declaration covering the row-ideal determinant lemmas, the Gram change-of-family identity, or the determinant-one minor invariance, and the PR reuses `det_mul_column`, `det_submatrix_mul_left` and `IsUpperUnitriangular.det_eq_one` rather than re-deriving them. The full-row-minor and unitriangular wrappers are one-line applications that roadmap \u00a7\u00a73.1\u20133.2 asks for by name.",
